 quality built-in appliances, ample storage and generous countertop space, making it ideal for both daily living and entertaining.<br> <br> Both bedrooms are generously sized and feature premium furnishings, built-in wardrobes and large windows. The modern bathrooms are finished with high-quality fittings, completing this elegant residence.<br> <br> Situated in the heart of Dubai Marina, Orra Marina offers residents an outstanding lifestyle with direct access to the Marina promenade, world-class dining, cafés, supermarkets, Marina Mall, the Metro and Sheikh Zayed Road.<br> <br> Residents enjoy an excellent collection of premium amenities including:<br> <br> • Chiller Free<br> • Resort-style Swimming Pool<br> • Fully Equipped Gymnasium<br> • Padel Court &amp; Multi-purpose Sports Court<br> • Jacuzzi<br> • Sauna &amp; Steam Rooms<br> • Children’s Play Area<br> • Games Room<br> • 24-Hour Security &amp; Concierge<br> • Covered Parking<br> • High-Speed Elevators<br> <br> Whether you’re searching for a stylish waterfront residence or a premium lifestyle in the heart of Dubai Marina, this beautifully designed apartment offers exceptional value, comfort and convenience<br> ","longitude":55.1352524,"negotiator_id":"11982","negotiator_mapping":"angelina@providentestate.com","parking":["1"],"price":140000,"price_qualifier":null,"publish":1,"search_type":"lettings","slug":"2-bedroom-apartment-to-rent-in-orra-marina-dubai-marina-dubai","status":"To Let","thumbnail":"http://provident-bx-upload-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/iblock/8b7/8b78eb750ef366e41f78f90f3acb4197/0E7E415E_26D9_4847_9FE5_A23FAA6D195B.jpg","title":"2 bedroom apartment to rent","extra":{"views":"","cheques":"3","project":null,"bitrix_id":"1478550","furnished":"Furnished","permit_number":"7131769600","rental_period":"Yearly","current_status":"","furnishing_type":"Furnished","completion_status":"completed","property_condition":"","property_managed_by_us":""},"video_tour":[],"virtual_tour":[],"qr_code":null,"prem